<programme start="20261108123600 +0000" stop="20261108133400 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Secrets to Civilization</title><sub-title lang="en">Bronze Age Catastrophe</sub-title><desc lang="en">In the last decade, the search for data about the planet&apos;s environmental history has raised questions about how climate change has influenced human civilizations in the past.</desc><credits><actor>Jimmy</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20673555_b_v8_as.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108133400 +0000" stop="20261108143200 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Queens of Ancient Egypt</title><sub-title lang="en">Cleopatra&apos;s Daughter</sub-title><desc lang="en">Cleopatra Selene, daughter of Cleopatra the Great and Mark Antony, saw her dynasty collapse amid her parents&apos; defeat and suicide; taken to Rome as a prisoner, all looked lost for Selene, but she rose from the embers to marry the African king Juba II.</desc><credits><actor>Michael Magnet</actor><actor>Danny O&apos;Connor</actor><actor>Wardah Khan</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24711169_i_s3_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108143200 +0000" stop="20261108153100 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Queens of Ancient Egypt</title><sub-title lang="en">The Other Cleopatra</sub-title><desc lang="en">Cleopatra II, namesake of the great Cleopatra VII, had a reign of incest, murder, rape and mutilation; she wielded great power and would do anything to keep it, and she saw her dynasty torn apart by hatred but also saved it from destruction.</desc><credits><actor>Vanessa Milchrahm</actor><actor>Anaïs Rizzo</actor><actor>Nathan Clough</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24711169_b_v11_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108153100 +0000" stop="20261108163600 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Ancient Murders Unearthed</title><sub-title lang="en">Ötzi the Iceman</sub-title><desc lang="en">Homicide detective Rod Demery and Professor Turi King examine Europe&apos;s well-known ancient murder victim, who was frozen where he was killed over 5,000 years ago; the team learns how pollen in his gut can suggest his likely route before he died.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24517193_b_s4_ah.jpg"/></programme>
