<programme start="20261108192900 +0000" stop="20261108202700 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Queens of Ancient Egypt</title><sub-title lang="en">Cleopatra&apos;s Daughter</sub-title><desc lang="en">Cleopatra Selene, daughter of Cleopatra the Great and Mark Antony, saw her dynasty collapse amid her parents&apos; defeat and suicide; taken to Rome as a prisoner, all looked lost for Selene, but she rose from the embers to marry the African king Juba II.</desc><credits><actor>Michael Magnet</actor><actor>Danny O&apos;Connor</actor><actor>Wardah Khan</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24711169_i_s3_aa.jpg"/></programme>
