<programme start="20261109050000 +0000" stop="20261109080000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Alabama at LSU</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 5 Alabama Crimson Tide (6-2) plays the No. 14 LSU Tigers at Tiger Stadium in Baton Rouge. Alabama enters off a 31-20 victory over Texas A&amp;M behind Keelon Russell&apos;s three touchdowns. LSU beat Auburn 38-17 behind Sam Leavitt&apos;s three touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
