<programme start="20261109150000 +0000" stop="20261109180000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Clemson at Syracuse</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Tigers (5-3, 3-2 ACC) try to exact revenge from the Orange (4-4, 2-4). Syracuse snapped a six-game series slide with a 34-21 upset victory in 2025. The Orange have won two straight, by a combined four points, after surprising SMU last week.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
