<programme start="20261109173000 +0000" stop="20261109183000 +0000" channel="History 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">History&apos;s Greatest Mysteries</title><sub-title lang="en">The Final Flight of Amelia Earhart</sub-title><desc lang="en">Amelia Earhart, the world&apos;s most famous female pilot, takes off on the final leg of a record-breaking flight; but Earhart never arrives at her next stop: an island in the Pacific Ocean; the search for this flier has revealed conflicting stories.</desc><credits><actor>Robert R. Cargill</actor><actor>Caroline Cory</actor><actor>Michael Dennin</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p18974386_b_v12_bw.jpg"/></programme>
