<programme start="20261109040000 +0000" stop="20261109060000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Iona at St. John&apos;s</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Iona Gaels visit the No. 13 St. John&apos;s Red Storm for an NCAA Division I game in New York. Iona rides a two-game win streak alongside guard Kevon Vanderhorst, and St. John&apos;s enters with a 78-63 victory over Monmouth with guard Keyshawn Hall.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109060000 +0000" stop="20261109080000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Crystal Palace vs. Liverpool</sub-title><desc lang="en">Crystal Palace play host to Liverpool at Selhurst Park. Crystal Palace rely on home resolve after gathering seven points from nine games, while Liverpool counts on four league victories and 15 points to secure an away top-flight victory.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109080000 +0000" stop="20261109100000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Nottingham Forest vs. Manchester City</sub-title><desc lang="en">Nottingham Forest host Manchester City in Matchweek 10 of the Premier League at the City Ground. Forest sit 19th after one win in four league games, while City arrive second in the standings but have lost their last two league games.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109100000 +0000" stop="20261109110000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">The Vault</title><sub-title lang="en">Game of the Century</sub-title><desc lang="en">In 1993, No. 1 Florida State played No. 2 Notre Dame at Notre Dame Stadium; it was billed as the Game of the Century and most predicted this would be an elimination game for the National Championship.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p27681917_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
