<programme start="20261110091800 +0000" stop="20261110110300 +0000" channel="Starz Encore Español(West) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Pound of Flesh</title><desc lang="en">Deacon, un exagente de las fuerzas de élite, viaja a China para donar uno de sus riñones a su sobrina. Sin embargo, cae en la red de una mafia dedicada al robo de órganos. Ahora, para salvar la vida de su sobrina, debe capturar a los traficantes.</desc><credits><actor>Jean-Claude Van Damme</actor><actor>Darren Shahlavi</actor><actor>Terese Cilluffo</actor></credits><date>20150101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Action</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p11492503_p_v8_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108093800 +0000" stop="20261108111100 +0000" channel="Starz Encore Family (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Midnight Sun</title><desc lang="en">A teen who lives with a life-threatening sensitivity to sunlight finds romance with a young man she&apos;s admired for years. As their relationship starts to blossom, she desperately tries to hide her condition from her unsuspecting new beau.</desc><credits><actor>Bella Thorne</actor><actor>Patrick Schwarzenegger</actor><actor>Rob Riggle</actor></credits><date>20180101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13401697_p_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108111100 +0000" stop="20261108122600 +0000" channel="Starz Encore Family (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Moon and Back</title><desc lang="en">High school senior Lydia Gilbert feels lost after her father&apos;s death, until she discovers a space opera script written by him. Equipped with a VHS camera and pocket change, she decides to honor her dad and make the script a reality.</desc><credits><actor>Isabel May</actor><actor>Missi Pyle</actor><actor>Nat Faxon</actor></credits><date>20220101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Comedy</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p26971894_i_s2_aa.jpg"/></programme>
