<programme start="20261110041300 +0000" stop="20261110055800 +0000" channel="Starz Kids &amp; Family 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Honor List</title><desc lang="en">Four girls sink a time capsule in a lake with a list of things they want to do before graduation, but they all go separate ways before graduating. When a tragedy strikes, they reunite to find the capsule and complete the bucket list.</desc><credits><actor>Meghan Rienks</actor><actor>Sasha Pieterse</actor><actor>Karrueche Tran</actor></credits><date>20180101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15249644_i_h10_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261110055800 +0000" stop="20261110072500 +0000" channel="Starz Kids &amp; Family 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Sea Level 3: Dolphin Boy</title><desc lang="en">A little boy survives a plane crash and is rescued by a young wild dolphin. They grow up together, entertaining marine life with their funny tricks. One day, the peace of their joyful world is destroyed by an evil octopus.</desc><credits><actor>Polina Avdeyenko</actor><actor>Aleksandr Fenin</actor><actor>Vasilisa Ruchimskaya</actor></credits><date>20220101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Animated</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22645337_i_s2_ab.jpg"/></programme>
